Support country  in scaling-up access to rehabilitation services and assistive products through situational assessment and policy development; 
Support to the MoH with development of national strategy on rehabilitation.
Developing roadmap for introduction of national Assistive Product List

Support to response coordination through establishment and strengthening of public health Emergency Operations Centres (PHEOCs) and engagement into a regional network;
Support to strengthen the People centered Emergency Care Systems (ECS) integrated with emergency preparedness and response (EPR), including assessment, setting key priorities and development of the road map;
Support to Emergency Medical Team (EMTs) awareness, classification, mentoring and coordination

Comprehensive health financing (HF) policy support to large-scale UHC reforms (UHC-Partnership); 
Country-specific policy guidance/analytical work on selected health financing topics (health insurance reforms, strategic purchasing, provider payment, public financial management, public-private-partnership, digital solutions;
Support national budget dialogue to ensure adequate public investment in health, particularly prioritizing increased investments in PHC and mental health;
Participation in regional capacity building activities on health financing for universal health coverage and health systems strengthening;
Financial protection (FP) monitoring report;
Support policy dialogue to identify options for improving financial protection;
Technical assistance to improve financial protection mechanisms;
National Health Accounts - Technical assistance to improve the national health accounts system and produce updated reports;
Capacity building on the generation and use of national health accounts.

Support to building and strengthening national AMR Surveillance networks, by connecting national networks with CAESAR and GLASS;, including laboratory capacity building, promotion of international standards;
AMR Awareness & behavior - Raising AMR Awareness and applying behaviour and cultural insight by development and dissemination of WAAW campaign materials, AMR advocacy briefs;
Support national AMR action plan finalization and implementation, including establishment and strengthening of intersectoral governance. Support development of indicators and evaluation framework.

HRH Assessment;
Support in developing National Health workforce (HWF) Strategy;
Rural Retention HWs

Non-Communicable Diseases control: NCD control and addressing risk factors;
Salt Plan - Salt Plan development and implementation;
NCD Investment - Support NCD Investment case, action plan and policy dialogue;
Evidence - Evidence generation on NCD risk factors, including FEEDCirties, STEPS2022, COSI2022, Salt in 24 hours urine

Improving access to Mental Health services :
Support policy dialogue on mental health; 
Capacity building to increase coverage and quality of mental health services

Technical support in management of Measles Outbreaks;
Technical support to strengthening measles laboratory support;
Technical support in elimination of measles and rubella verification

Supporting strategic planning of TB activities;
Implementing Multi-sectoral accountability Framework on TB (MAF-TB) : Country support on implementation of MAF-TB;
TB Diagnosis - Improving diagnosis of TB and Drug-resistant (DR)-TB;
Treatment of TB/MDR-  Improving treatment success of TB and DR-TB

Strategic planning for Viral Hepatitis;
Testing and Treatment for Viral Hepatitis;
Viral Hepatitis prevention

